01:14:57,800 --> 01:15:00,670
- Then shall we get going?
- Let's go.

2019
01:15:00,970 --> 01:15:03,039
Let's go have fun.

2020
01:15:03,040 --> 01:15:04,069
(The excited members and dreary atmosphere)

2021
01:15:04,070 --> 01:15:05,340
- Shall we gather in the yard?
- Okay.

2022
01:15:05,770 --> 01:15:07,170
I'll just get changed.

2023
01:15:07,910 --> 01:15:09,739
Go out first.

2024
01:15:09,740 --> 01:15:10,780
(They get ready and gather in the yard.)

2025
01:15:11,450 --> 01:15:12,510
It's so cool.

2026
01:15:13,580 --> 01:15:15,050
Is that your downtown outfit?

2027
01:15:15,780 --> 01:15:16,780
Yes.

2028
01:15:17,120 --> 01:15:20,450
Yu Jin told us to wear white, so I did.

2029
01:15:21,190 --> 01:15:22,589
She's coming out.

2030
01:15:22,590 --> 01:15:25,029
- Can I go downtown like this?
- Sure.

2031
01:15:25,030 --> 01:15:26,089
- Really?
- Yes.

2032
01:15:26,090 --> 01:15:27,160
I'll go like this.

2033
01:15:27,260 --> 01:15:30,130
I am Queen Dowager

2034
01:15:30,836 --> 01:15:33,705
(And the last member)

2035
01:15:33,730 --> 01:15:34,900
You look pretty.

2036
01:15:36,070 --> 01:15:37,199
- You look like a first love.
- She's here.

2037
01:15:37,200 --> 01:15:38,309
- She has the first love look.
- She's here.

2038
01:15:38,310 --> 01:15:39,569
You look like a first love.

2039
01:15:39,570 --> 01:15:40,940
You must've waited for today to come.

2040
01:15:41,340 --> 01:15:43,679
So much. It's our Teheran-ro.

2041
01:15:43,680 --> 01:15:45,380
I even brought these shoes.

2042
01:15:45,480 --> 01:15:46,510
The downtown outfit.

2043
01:15:47,010 --> 01:15:49,250
Do we go to the photo studio first?

2044
01:15:49,680 --> 01:15:52,089
- The studio first?
- That's good and all,

2045
01:15:52,090 --> 01:15:54,450
but when you were making rice cakes,

2046
01:15:54,720 --> 01:15:56,890
the headquarters called.

2047
01:15:57,590 --> 01:15:58,390
What did they say?

2048
01:15:58,930 --> 01:16:01,060
They opened a second branch in Seoul.

2049
01:16:01,430 --> 01:16:02,630
What are you talking about? Now?

2050
01:16:02,730 --> 01:16:03,760
We're going to Seoul?

2051
01:16:03,860 --> 01:16:06,230
- We're going to Seoul?
- I told you.

2052
01:16:06,330 --> 01:16:08,269
- I finally got used to the kitchen.
- The kitchen and everything...

2053
01:16:08,270 --> 01:16:10,500
- We got used to this kitchen.
- Exactly.

2054
01:16:11,000 --> 01:16:12,040
I quit!

2055
01:16:12,640 --> 01:16:15,479
- Hold on.
- Go on a strike.

2056
01:16:15,480 --> 01:16:18,479
- Go on a strike.
- Why?

2057
01:16:18,480 --> 01:16:19,979
- What's wrong?
- Young Ji...

2058
01:16:19,980 --> 01:16:21,379
- I can't do this.
- You wanted to go to Seoul.

2059
01:16:21,380 --> 01:16:22,380
This is different!

2060
01:16:22,381 --> 01:16:24,049
You said you wanted to go to Seoul.

2061
01:16:24,050 --> 01:16:25,889
- That's why they prepared this.
- No!

2062
01:16:25,890 --> 01:16:27,719
- I barely got used to the kitchen.
- If I say I want to do business...

2063
01:16:27,720 --> 01:16:29,519
in the USA, will we go there?

2064
01:16:29,520 --> 01:16:30,789
We were going to go there then.

2065
01:16:30,790 --> 01:16:33,360
If you'd said that, we would've done it.

2066
01:16:33,690 --> 01:16:36,059
- Is she dead?
- They need to adjust again...

2067
01:16:36,060 --> 01:16:37,130
- She...
- You want to go to the USA?

2068
01:16:37,500 --> 01:16:38,899
Young Ji, do you want to go to the USA?

2069
01:16:38,900 --> 01:16:40,869
Didn't you just say that you want to go to the USA?

2070
01:16:40,870 --> 01:16:42,069
She ran her mouth.

2071
01:16:42,206 --> 01:16:43,340
I love Seoul, though.

2072
01:16:43,570 --> 01:16:46,670
Hold on. We've finally gotten used to the whole system now.

2073
01:16:46,840 --> 01:16:48,679
We're starting to feel attached to the restaurant.

2074
01:16:48,680 --> 01:16:50,439
- I can't leave this place.
- No.

2075
01:16:50,440 --> 01:16:53,279
- Why...
- It's finally stabilized.

2076
01:16:53,280 --> 01:16:54,719
The HQ is saying...

2077
01:16:54,720 --> 01:16:56,120
since you've stabilized this place already,

2078
01:16:56,680 --> 01:16:58,550
come and do the same for the second branch...

2079
01:16:59,150 --> 01:17:00,650
with your expertise.

2080
01:17:01,290 --> 01:17:03,860
When you're in business, you have to expand.

2081
01:17:04,760 --> 01:17:06,730
(The second challenge they face)

2082
01:17:06,790 --> 01:17:07,859
(Yeonhui-dong, Seoul)

2083
01:17:07,860 --> 01:17:09,099
- Gosh, what?
- I'm intimidated.

2084
01:17:09,100 --> 01:17:10,329
- What?
- What is it?

2085
01:17:10,330 --> 01:17:11,529
(Shocked)

2086
01:17:11,530 --> 01:17:13,369
Hold on. This is a pop-up store.

2087
01:17:13,370 --> 01:17:16,000
- What is this? Get rid of it!
- What do we do now?

2088
01:17:16,240 --> 01:17:17,500
There are so many tables.

2089
01:17:17,940 --> 01:17:19,740
Seven, eight, nine...

2090
01:17:19,940 --> 01:17:21,979
- It's so new.
- We have new equipment.

2091
01:17:21,980 --> 01:17:24,750
- What is that?
- We're making burgers.

2092
01:17:25,110 --> 01:17:26,750
I think we have to make burgers.

2093
01:17:27,350 --> 01:17:29,979
Tomorrow, you'll hold a brand launch event.

2094
01:17:29,980 --> 01:17:31,849
I see. Like a pop-up store.

2095
01:17:31,850 --> 01:17:33,520
It's like a mini Met Gala.

2096
01:17:36,790 --> 01:17:37,859
Does this make sense?

2097
01:17:37,860 --> 01:17:39,789
It's obvious to see that we're doing it.

2098
01:17:39,790 --> 01:17:42,429
Gosh. This is quite the event.

2099
01:17:42,430 --> 01:17:43,500
A photowall?

2100
01:17:44,600 --> 01:17:46,569
Gosh. You look pretty, Chef.

2101
01:17:46,570 --> 01:17:48,040
Here is Mimi.

2102
01:17:48,140 --> 01:17:49,999
Eun Ji is here.

2103
01:17:50,000 --> 01:17:51,139
Goodness.

2104
01:17:51,140 --> 01:17:52,539
Please look to your left.

2105
01:17:52,540 --> 01:17:54,780
You look like Yang Hee Eun.

2106
01:17:55,540 --> 01:17:58,409
Look. This is the Met Gala now.

2107
01:17:58,410 --> 01:18:01,480
Congratulations.

2108
01:18:02,220 --> 01:18:03,220
(Laughing)

2109
01:18:03,245 --> 01:18:04,086
Louder!

2110
01:18:04,720 --> 01:18:05,949
Yes!

2111
01:18:05,950 --> 01:18:07,720
Thank you, everyone.

2112
01:18:08,220 --> 01:18:10,919
- One, two, three!
- Two, three!

2113
01:18:10,920 --> 01:18:12,389
(The grand opening...)

2114
01:18:12,390 --> 01:18:13,829
(of the 2nd branch of Space Rice Cake)

2115
01:18:13,830 --> 01:18:15,100
Bye, everyone.

2116
01:18:15,430 --> 01:18:16,700
Bye.

2117
01:18:16,730 --> 01:18:17,800
It's nice and cool.

2118
01:18:18,570 --> 01:18:19,630
For goodness' sake.

2119
01:18:19,770 --> 01:18:21,469
- What?
- Hello.

2120
01:18:21,470 --> 01:18:23,039
- What?
- What?

2121
01:18:23,040 --> 01:18:24,600
What is it? Am I forbidden to come here?

2122
01:18:24,870 --> 01:18:26,769
(Coming up next)

2123
01:18:26,770 --> 01:18:28,909
(We were selling tteokbokki in Goheung a moment ago.)

2124
01:18:28,910 --> 01:18:30,439
(I'm dreaming, right?)

2125
01:18:30,440 --> 01:18:31,910
(This has to be a dream.)

2126
01:18:32,210 --> 01:18:33,950
(This is real.)

2127
01:18:34,210 --> 01:18:36,750
(They're overwhelmed by the sheer scale of it.)

2128
01:18:36,880 --> 01:18:40,490
(So, Manager Kwon from the HQ comes to help them again!)

2129
01:18:40,750 --> 01:18:41,819
(Unveiling many new dishes...)

2130
01:18:41,820 --> 01:18:46,530
(that fit the vibe of Seoul!)

2131
01:18:46,660 --> 01:18:49,159
(This basil mayo is incredible.)

2132
01:18:49,160 --> 01:18:50,930
(This is more than just good.)

2133
01:18:51,160 --> 01:18:53,470
(It's so good that it makes you dance.)

2134
01:18:53,670 --> 01:18:56,740
(Totally satisfied with the new dishes)

2135
01:18:56,870 --> 01:18:59,909
(We're having burgers for the staff meal today.)

2136
01:18:59,910 --> 01:19:03,039
(Delivery versus Space Rice Cake, Burger showdown)

2137
01:19:03,040 --> 01:19:04,809
(Are we even getting mock reviews?)

2138
01:19:04,810 --> 01:19:07,550
(Do we get brutally honest reviews right after practicing it?)

2139
01:19:07,680 --> 01:19:08,719
(Chop the onions.)

2140
01:19:08,720 --> 01:19:10,419
(How are we going to do all this within an hour?)

2141
01:19:10,420 --> 01:19:13,050
(The race against the clock begins amid the tension.)

2142
01:19:13,690 --> 01:19:15,419
(We just learned the recipe today.)

2143
01:19:15,420 --> 01:19:17,990
(We learned it today.)

2144
01:19:18,330 --> 01:19:21,260
(As the time limit approaches,)

2145
01:19:21,500 --> 01:19:26,770
(their hands move faster.)

2146
01:19:27,270 --> 01:19:32,670
(And the staff starts to gather.)

2147
01:19:33,140 --> 01:19:35,110
(The final evaluation of the staff meal)

2148
01:19:35,210 --> 01:19:36,940
(Maybe it's a harsh review.)

2149
01:19:37,180 --> 01:19:38,210
(What now?)

2150
01:19:38,550 --> 01:19:40,209
(What will become of the new dishes...)

2151
01:19:40,210 --> 01:19:41,880
(prior to the grand opening of the 2nd branch?)

2152
01:19:48,360 --> 01:19:49,920
(Space Rice Cake)

2153
01:19:50,390 --> 01:19:52,990
(Space Rice Cake)
